{
  "id": "125",
  "title": "Pretty or Ugly",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-05-07",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming's father talks about whose wives are pretty or ugly when Little Ming's mother asks him the ultimate question: “So am I pretty or ugly?”",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/124/a2da7fcc59a73cb7de12f3257b1a9beea4b9ce29.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "好看还是难看\n\n    一天，小明的爸爸说：“大家都说小李的老婆好看，老陈的老婆难看。”\n    小明的妈妈问：“那我呢？”\n    小明的爸爸想了想，说：“嗯…你是她们的综合。”\n    小明的妈妈问：“那到底是好看还是难看？\n    小明的爸爸说：“是‘好难看’。”",
    "traditional": "好看還是難看\n\n    一天，小明的爸爸說：“大家都說小李的老婆好看，老陳的老婆難看。”\n    小明的媽媽問：“那我呢？”\n    小明的爸爸想了想，說：“嗯…你是她們的綜合。”\n    小明的媽媽問：“那到底是好看還是難看？\n    小明的爸爸說：“是‘好難看’。”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Pretty or Ugly"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "一天，小明的爸爸说：“大家都说小李的老婆好看，老陈的老婆难看。”",
      "traditional": "一天，小明的爸爸說：“大家都說小李的老婆好看，老陳的老婆難看。”",
      "pinyin": "yì tiān xiǎo míng de bà ba shuō dà jiā dōu shuō xiǎo lǐ de lǎo po hǎo kàn lǎo chén de lǎo po nán kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "One day, Little Ming's father said: “Everyone says Little Li's wife is pretty, and that Old Chen's wife is ugly.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈问：“那我呢？”",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽問：“那我呢？”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma wèn nà wǒ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming's mother asked: “So what about me?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸想了想，说：“嗯…你是她们的综合。”",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸想了想，說：“嗯…你是她們的綜合。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba xiǎng le xiǎng shuō èn nǐ shì tā men de zōng hé",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming's father thought for a while, then said: “Hmm, you're a mix of the two of them.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈问：“那到底是好看还是难看？",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽問：“那到底是好看還是難看？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma wèn nà dào dǐ shì hǎo kàn hái shi nán kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming's mother asked: “So does that mean I'm pretty or ugly?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸说：“是‘好难看’。”",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸說：“是‘好難看’。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba shuō shì hǎo nán kàn",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
